 von Neumann, J., & Burks, A. W. (1966). *Theory of Self-Reproducing Automata.* University of Illinois Press.
 
+Wang, Y., Xia, L., Liu, R., Zhang, Z., Wu, H., Yang, Y., He, J., Guo, Y., & Lei, K. (2026). SAGE: A statistical acceptance gate for self-evolving agents. *arXiv preprint* arXiv:2609.36043.
